In the Obtain occurrence data module, when Enter species scientific name, the format requirement is Genus specie, if i put a subspecies name here which is three (Genus name, species name, subspecies), an error will be pop out (! ERROR : Please input both genus and species names)? How can we deal with subspecies name here in Wallace?
